## 1. SCOPE, DEFENSIVE RED-TEAM POSTURE, & PUBLIC-DOMAIN BOUNDARY (`INVARIANT 30`)

Whereas `SPEC-2026-STIGMERGIC-AERIAL-SWARM-AND-COUNTER-UAS-CYBERNETICS-v1.0` governs **civil, commercial, and residential curtilage airspace** (Kademlia XOR search/rescue deconfliction, BFT GNSS anti-cheat, and FAA `14 C.F.R. Part 89` Remote-ID Harm Beacons), this companion specification models the **mathematical, procurement, and electronic-warfare (EW) game theory** of heterogeneous multi-agent swarms to expose structural vulnerabilities in legacy air-defense and acquisition architectures.

Pursuant to **Invariant 30 (22 C.F.R. § 120.34 ITAR Public Domain & 15 C.F.R. § 734.7 EAR Published Fundamental Research)**, this document operates strictly at the **abstract mathematical, economic, and control-theoretic systems level** (comparable to published academic literature on Lanchester attrition equations, Couzin/Reynolds flocking, Multi-Armed Bandits, and textbook bistatic radar equations). It provides **zero physical manufacturing blueprints, CAD drawings, circuit schematics, component bills-of-materials (BOMs), assembly instructions, or export-controlled guidance/fuzing firmware** under 22 C.F.R. § 120.33 (USML Categories IV, XI, or XII) or 15 C.F.R. § 774 (CCL Category 9). It formalizes five game-theoretic models for defensive red-team evaluation:

1. **The Sortie A/B Procurement Crucible:** Replacing ex-ante prime-contractor monocultures with Bayesian Thompson-sampled allocation markets and Herfindahl-Hirschman Index ($\text{HHI} \le 0.15$) anti-monoculture bounds.
2. **Physical Mixture-of-Experts ("MoE in the Sky"), 3-Stage State Fallback & Percolation Decoy Mixing:** Decoupling high-CapEx long-range perception nodes from low-CapEx terminal effector nodes equipped with a 3-stage control-theoretic fallback state machine and lateral Couzin/Reynolds neighbor velocity alignment.
3. **Ground-Clutter Doppler Notch Stasis ("Tick" Thermodynamics):** Modeling how zero-velocity ground stasis ($v_r = 0\text{ m/s}$) inside textbook Pulse-Doppler Moving Target Indicator (MTI) clutter notches defeats airborne loiter energy bleed.
4. **The Electromagnetic *Zugzwang* (Parasitic Bistatic Jamming Inversion):** Proving the Nash equilibrium trap wherein high-wattage active jamming increases passive bistatic Signal-to-Noise Ratio ($\text{SNR}_{\text{Bistatic}} \propto P_{\text{Tx}}$) and Time-Difference-of-Arrival (TDOA) observability, while emission silence (`EMCON`) surrenders active radar tracking.
5. **Counter-Intuitive Boundary & Substrate Inversions (Defensive Perimeter Audit):** Auditing legacy air-defense perimeter assumptions against Zero-C2 Nap-of-the-Earth Radio-Horizon physics, LOAC-compliant Rear-to-Front Velocity-Gate Inversion, Co-Located Military Logistics Fratricide Deadlocks, Thermodynamic Heat-Dissipation Surface Exposure, and Little's Law Centralized C2 Queueing Collapse.

