## 6. VECTOR V: COUNTER-INTUITIVE BOUNDARY & SUBSTRATE INVERSIONS — DEFENSIVE RED-TEAM PERIMETER AUDIT (`INVARIANT 1, 2, & 6`)

Conventional air-defense and critical-infrastructure architectures rely on linear frontline geometry, human-in-the-loop C2 assumptions, and symmetric armor protection biases. Red-team game-theoretic modeling exposes five structural perimeter vulnerabilities that defensive architects must remediate:

### 6.1 The Radio-Horizon Liberation Law (Why Legacy UAVs Flew High vs. Zero-C2 Nap-of-the-Earth)
* **The Legacy C2 Bottleneck:** Conventional remotely piloted UAVs historically operated at $100\text{m}\text{--}3,000\text{m}$ altitude—directly inside air-defense radar line-of-sight—because a human remote operator requires a continuous **Fresnel-zone radio line-of-sight ($d_{\text{horizon}} \approx 3.57\sqrt{h_{\text{meters}}}\text{ km}$)**.
* **The Zero-C2 Nap-of-the-Earth Audit (`Invariant 6`):** Eliminating continuous human video downlinks (`Tokens_C2 = 0`) decouples autonomous transit altitude from the radio horizon. When autonomous agents transit at **$h = 1.0\text{--}2.5\text{ meters}$ Above Ground Level (AGL)**, terrain masking collapses the geometric radar horizon of ground-based mast radars to $< 500\text{ meters}$, proving that legacy mast-mounted SHORAD cannot rely on high-altitude line-of-sight detection.

### 6.2 LOAC-Compliant Rear-to-Front Heading Inversion (Auditing Directional Velocity-Gate Filters)
* **Strict LOAC Compliance (Protocol I, Art. 37(2)):** Under the Law of Armed Conflict, spoofing adversary cryptographic IFF codes, civilian airliner transponders, or protected medical emblems constitutes unlawful perfidy and is **strictly prohibited** by this specification. Conversely, operating in emission silence (`EMCON`) and maneuvering along non-standard compass vectors are lawful ruses of war.
* **The Directional Velocity-Gate Vulnerability:** Legacy radar track-while-scan filters frequently employ **Vector-Origin Heuristics**: tracks moving from the adversary side toward friendly lines ($\mathbf{v} \cdot \hat{\mathbf{u}}_{\text{Front}} < 0$) are prioritized as hostile, whereas tracks moving from the friendly rear *toward* the frontline ($\mathbf{v} \cdot \hat{\mathbf{u}}_{\text{Front}} > 0$) are de-prioritized as outbound friendly assets.
* **Defensive Takeaway:** Any perimeter defense filter that assigns trust based on heading sign ($\mathbf{v} \cdot \hat{\mathbf{u}}_{\text{Front}} > 0$) fails against autonomous agents that bypass the forward line and approach along rear-to-front vectors without emitting spoofed IFF bits.

### 6.3 Parasitic Military-Logistics Hitchhiking & Co-Located Asset Fratricide Deadlock
* **The Mechanistic Mismatch & LOAC Art. 52(2) Distinction Gate:** Long-range aerodynamic transit expends $>90\%$ of small-airframe battery capacity. However, military perimeters are crossed daily by dedicated **military logistics convoys**. (Pursuant to **Geneva Protocol I Art. 48 & 52(2)**, any theoretical model of logistics transit is strictly bounded to validated military logistics vehicles; interaction with civilian, commercial, or medical transport is categorically prohibited).
* **The Co-Located Fratricide Deadlock:** In game-theoretic defense modeling, if a passive sensor or attritable node transits in close physical proximity to a validated military logistics asset ($0.0\text{ W}$ propulsion expenditure), kinetic point-defense systems (CIWS / fragmentation interceptors) face a **Co-Located Asset Fratricide Deadlock**: engaging the proximate threat with high-explosive interceptors risks collateral destruction of the defender's own military logistics platform.

### 6.4 The Unarmorable Heat-Sink Law (Thermodynamic Vulnerability of High-Wattage Systems)
* **The Perverse Incentive of "Kill-Cam" Attrition:** Legacy attrition metrics fixate on heavily armored platforms ($600\text{mm}$ Rolled Homogeneous Armor).
* **The Thermodynamic Heat-Sink Law (`Invariant 2`):** Every high-energy emitter or compute/power node (multi-megawatt phased-array radars, high-power EW transmitters, and mobile power substations) is bound by the Second Law of Thermodynamics: **a heat exchanger cannot be hermetically armored without blocking convective/radiative heat transfer ($Q = h A \Delta T$).** High-wattage systems must expose high-surface-area thermal dissipation manifolds directly to ambient airflow.
* **Defensive Engineering Mandate:** In Lanchester attrition modeling, unprotected thermal dissipation surfaces represent a $>100\times$ higher **Systemic Megawatt-Hours Disabled per Unit Mass** sensitivity than armored hulls, requiring defensive architects to recess, baffle, and physically screen all heat-exchange manifolds against low-RCS autonomous ingress.

### 6.5 Multi-Sector Attention-Splitting vs. Centralized C2 Queueing Collapse (Little's Law)
* **The Centralized ROE / Dwell-Time Bottleneck:** A centralized air-defense network cannot operate on unconstrained full-auto across all sectors without risking catastrophic fratricide (shooting down friendly aircraft) and instant magazine depletion against $50 decoys. It requires centralized human ROE arbitration ($\sim 40\text{ bits/s}$ cognitive ceiling) and finite phased-array radar dwell-time scheduling ($\tau_{\text{dwell}}$) across a shared C2 backhaul capacity $\mu_{\text{C2}}$.
* **Little's Law Asymptotic Collapse:** A zero-C2 stigmergic swarm incurs **$\mathcal{O}(1)$ constant coordination cost** regardless of whether it attacks along $K = 1$ bearing or splits across $K = 12$ orthogonal azimuths and rear-sector depots simultaneously. For the centralized defender, as the multi-sector arrival rate $\Lambda = \sum_{k=1}^K \lambda_k \to \mu_{\text{C2}}$, queuing latency $W_{\text{C2}}$ blows up hyperbolically:
  $$W_{\text{C2}}(K) = \frac{1}{\mu_{\text{C2}} - \sum_{k=1}^K \lambda_k} \to \infty \quad \implies \quad W_{\text{C2}}(K) > \tau_{\text{TerminalSprint}}$$
  When $K$ synchronized prongs arrive within the mechanical slew time ($\Delta t < \tau_{\text{slew}}$) and C2 arbitration window, the defender's fire-control loop experiences track-file starvation and cognitive deadlock.

