## 7. FORMAL CYBERNETIC & GAME-THEORETIC INVARIANTS

1. **Sortie A/B HHI Anti-Monoculture & OOB Thompson Sampling Invariant:**
   $$s_{\max,t} \le 0.15 \implies \text{HHI}_t = \sum_{i=1}^M s_{i,t}^2 \le 0.15 \;\land\; s_{i,t+1} \propto \text{ThompsonSample}\left(\text{Beta}(\alpha_{i,t} + \Delta\text{OOB}_{\text{Hit}},\; \beta_{i,t} + \Delta\text{OOB}_{\text{Miss}})\right)$$

2. **Physical Mixture-of-Experts (MoE), Non-Expendable Overseer, Probabilistic Salvo Redundancy & 3-Stage Degraded-Mode Control Fallback Invariant:**
   $$\mathbf{v}_i(t+\Delta t) = \alpha v_{\text{cruise}} \sum_{m} w_m(\text{SNR}_m) \hat{\mathbf{b}}_m + (1-\alpha)\langle \mathbf{v}_j \rangle_{j \in \mathcal{N}_i} \;\land\; K_k^* = \left\lceil \frac{\ln(1 - P_{\text{req}}(V_k))}{\ln(1 - p_k)} \right\rceil \implies \text{HighCapExSensorAttrition} = 0 \;\land\; \mathbb{P}(\text{Completion}\mid\text{OverseersLost}) > 0$$

3. **Ground-Clutter Doppler Notch Stasis Invariant:**
   $$v_r = 0 < v_{\text{MTI\_Notch}} \;\land\; P_{\text{Sleep}} \le 50\,\mu\text{W} \implies \text{RadarReturn}_{\text{MTI}} = 0 \;\land\; \tau_{\text{Loiter}} > 1,000\text{ h}$$

4. **Electromagnetic *Zugzwang* (Parasitic Bistatic Inversion) Invariant:**
   $$\frac{\partial (\text{SNR}_{\text{Bistatic}}^{\text{Swarm}})}{\partial P_{\text{Jammer}}^{\text{Adversary}}} > 0 \;\land\; P_{\text{RF}}^{\text{Swarm}} = 0 \implies P_{\text{Jammer}}^*(\text{Nash}) \to 0\text{ W (Forced EMCON)}$$

5. **Topological Boundary & C2 Queueing Collapse Invariant:**
   $$\text{Tokens}_{\text{C2}} = 0 \implies h_{\text{AGL}} \le 2.5\text{m} \;\land\; W_{\text{C2}}^{\text{Defender}}(K) = \frac{1}{\mu_{\text{C2}} - \sum_{k=1}^K \lambda_k} > \tau_{\text{Sprint}} \;\land\; \frac{\text{Disablement}(\text{HeatSink})}{\text{Disablement}(\text{Armor})} \ge 100\times$$

